{
  "slug": "paging-mcp",
  "name": "Paging Mcp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "FastMCP server that pages on-call via 100+ notification channels (Apprise wrapper). WhatsApp, ntfy, Pushover, Telegram, Twilio SMS, email.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 hook**, `SessionStart` and **1 MCP server**, `paging`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install paging-mcp@claude-community` from `adelaidasofia/paging-mcp`.\n\nFastMCP server that pages on-call via 100+ notification channels. Built on top of Apprise, which speaks WhatsApp, ntfy, Pushover, Telegram, Discord, Slack, Signal, Matrix, Gotify, mailto, Twilio SMS, AWS SNS, and dozens more.",
